DockerServiceName.description:
A Docker service name, distinct from its logical service name.

```compile_fail
use piqueld_core::{DockerNetworkName, DockerServiceName};
fn attach_network(_: DockerNetworkName) {}
fn wrong_kind(service: DockerServiceName) { attach_network(service); }
```

NormalizedApplication.description:
Canonical desired application plus persistence-assigned identity.

Configuration is immutable. Export input with [`Self::to_manifest`] and
validate edits before constructing a replacement.

```compile_fail
fn bypass_validation(app: &mut piqueld_core::NormalizedApplication) {
    app.spec.services.clear();
}
```

